# 20. Best Practices

✔ Start troubleshooting from the outermost layer.

✔ Read Events.

✔ Read Logs.

✔ Verify YAML.

✔ Check Secrets.

✔ Verify ConfigMaps.

✔ Validate Routes.

✔ Confirm Services.

✔ Avoid assumptions.

